From 8483dbf4b82c766c1ed97dc38290e82d32d27bab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Paul Robinson <parobin@microsoft.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:22:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(chamfer): add lead-in and lead-out

Reuse the shared lead vocabulary and constructors. Preserve legacy open-chain approaches unless a lead is stated. Refuse candidates that the full cutter assembly cannot clear.

Fixes #3237

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
